                                                "sense_id": "4a0c9300-0a89-30a1-975c-8681c8d1e8a9",
                                                "text": "For his part, the patient must avoid some commonplace substances in order to avoid antidoting or stopping the action of the homeopathic remedy[…]"
                                            }
